parts.text:
Add a generic focusable rule using control tokens:
```
[data-pathland-focusable]:focus-visible {
 outline: var(--pl-control-focus-ring-width) solid var(--pl-control-accent);
 outline-offset: var(--pl-control-focus-ring-offset);
}
```
Place in components.css near top. Then run design build/sync.

